{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Troop vs Troop</strong> is a tactical, turn-based combat game set in the gritty battlefields of World War II. Take command of a U.S. Army troop and lead units of infantry, tanks, and artillery through dynamically generated combat scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough throws you into a unique battlefield where strategic thinking is key. Use cover, flanking maneuvers, and combined arms tactics to outwit and outgun aggressive German forces. No two maps are the same\u2014procedural generation ensures fresh challenges every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Turn-based tactical combat with a focus on positioning and unit synergy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Procedurally generated maps for endless tactical variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0Control a diverse U.S. troop: infantry, tanks, and artillery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Engage against dynamic enemy forces in a WW2 setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategic gameplay inspired by classic squad tactics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731460?t=1763721120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731460?t=1763721120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731460/54d9d9c2f8bc20e25f710b04b8dc71f5dec68672/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763721120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731460/54d9d9c2f8bc20e25f710b04b8dc71f5dec68672/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763721120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descript